-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Played by the owner in JNext 1.1.104, 2026-11-07: approved. Run
              by script through the real loader on NextZXOS v2.09 and 26.11
              card copies.

  Replay      IDENTICAL on the archive-start recording (18,000 frames) and a
              last-life recording (4,000 frames): at every hook original and
              patched code compared from the same state, every register with R
              and all 48K RAM; Enhanced 2,936 complete pictures, 144 million
              pixels checked

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104; original beeper writes remain outside the
              accelerated renderer and at the original clock. Whole hidden
              ROM, original loading screen and sparse BASIC-safe veneers.

  Coverage    Recordings and soaks by script, no human play: menus, play,
              deaths, game over, initials entry and a new game; not reached:
              natural completion, joysticks

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
